.Dd 2025-09-30
.Dt EVP_CIPHER-NULL 7ossl
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm EVP_CIPHER-NULL
.Nd The NULL EVP_CIPHER implementation
.Sh DESCRIPTION
Support for a NULL symmetric encryption using the
.Sy EVP_CIPHER
API. This is used when the TLS cipher suite is TLS_NULL_WITH_NULL_NULL.
This does no encryption (just copies the data) and has a mac size of
zero.
.Ss Algorithm Name
The following algorithm is available in the default provider:
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It \(dqNULL"
.El
.Ss Parameters
This implementation supports the following parameters:
.Pp
.Em Gettable EVP_CIPHER parameters
.Pp
See
.Xr EVP_EncryptInit 3
.Pp
.Em Gettable EVP_CIPHER_CTX parameters
.Pp
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It \(dqkeylen" ( Ns Sy OSSL_CIPHER_PARAM_KEYLEN Ns ) <unsigned integer>
.It \(dqivlen" ( Ns Sy OSSL_CIPHER_PARAM_IVLEN No and < Ns Sy OSSL_CIPHER_PARAM_AEAD_IVLEN Ns ) <unsigned integer>
.It \(dqtls-mac" ( Ns Sy OSSL_CIPHER_PARAM_TLS_MAC Ns ) <octet ptr>
.El
See
.Xr EVP_EncryptInit 3
for further information.
.Pp
.Em Settable EVP_CIPHER_CTX parameters
.Pp
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It \(dqtls-mac-size" ( Ns Sy OSSL_CIPHER_PARAM_TLS_MAC_SIZE Ns ) <unsigned integer>
.El
See
.Xr EVP_EncryptInit 3
for further information.
.Sh CONFORMING TO
RFC 5246 section-6.2.3.1
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr provider-cipher 7 ,
.Xr OSSL_PROVIDER-default 7
